{"ticker":"VST","updated":"2026-11-20T23:26:30Z","profile":{"longName":"Vistra Corp.","shortName":"Vistra Corp.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Independent Power Producers","country":"United States","website":"https://vistracorp.com","fullTimeEmployees":6390,"marketCap":39115239424,"trailingPE":15.574324,"forwardPE":11.814284,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.8999048,"pegRatio":0.35,"targetMeanPrice":197.18262,"targetHighPrice":270.0,"targetLowPrice":106.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.277,"earningsGrowth":0.846,"grossMargins":0.41519,"operatingMargins":0.22999,"profitMargins":0.13148,"totalRevenue":20587999232,"beta":1.375,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":182.56,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":110.89,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.74},"summary":"Vistra Corp., together with its subsidiaries, operates as an integrated retail electricity and power generation company in the United States. The company operates through five segments: Retail, Texas, East, West, and Asset Closure. The company retails electricity and natural gas to residential, commercial, and industrial customers across states in the United States and the District of Columbia. It is also involved in electricity generation, wholesale energy purchases and sales, commodity risk management, fuel procurement, and fuel logistics management activities. In addition, the company engages in decommissioning and reclamation of retired generation facilities, including mines, and battery removal and remediation activities. It serves approximately 5 million customers with a generation capacity of approximately 44,000 megawatts with a portfolio of natural gas, nuclear, coal, solar, and battery energy storage facilities. The company was formerly known as Vistra Energy Corp. and changed its name to Vistra Corp. in July 2020. Vistra Corp. was founded in 1882 and is based in Irving, Texas.","summary_zh":"瑞致達公司及其子公司在美國作為一家綜合零售電力和發電公司運作。該公司透過五個部門運作：零售部門、德州部門、東部部門、西部部門和資產關閉部門。該公司向美國各州和哥倫比亞特區的住宅、商業和工業客戶零售電力和天然氣。它還涉及發電、批發能源採購和銷售、商品風險管理、燃料採購和燃料物流管理活動。此外，該公司還從事退役發電設施（包括礦場）的退役和回收，以及電池拆除和修復活動。該公司為約 500 萬客戶提供服務，發電量約 44,000 兆瓦，擁有天然氣、核能、煤炭、太陽能和電池儲能設施組合。該公司前身為瑞致達能源公司 (Vistra Energy Corp.)，於 2020 年 7 月更名為瑞致達公司 (Vistra Corp.)。瑞致達公司成立於 1882 年，總部位於德州歐文。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 獨立電力生產商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":211.0,"h":219.82,"l":207.8,"c":217.92,"v":4819500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":210.11,"h":212.765,"l":203.46,"c":204.24,"v":6525200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":203.26,"h":206.187,"l":201.87,"c":202.06,"v":3844400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":198.0,"h":204.26,"l":196.01,"c":201.62,"v":4262600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":201.2,"h":207.5,"l":200.98,"c":207.22,"v":3096200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":202.0,"h":207.127,"l":197.7,"c":197.94,"v":8373900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":199.19,"h":200.5,"l":190.7,"c":195.92,"v":5828400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":195.0,"h":204.93,"l":192.17,"c":201.51,"v":5387700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":204.04,"h":205.0,"l":198.71,"c":202.65,"v":4224200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":204.35,"h":210.2,"l":201.5,"c":201.99,"v":5306900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":206.16,"h":207.93,"l":197.43,"c":200.41,"v":6019800},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":201.57,"h":203.835,"l":195.885,"c":199.62,"v":2865800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":201.58,"h":206.61,"l":200.127,"c":206.55,"v":3706000},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":207.0,"h":211.07,"l":205.335,"c":210.0,"v":3796100},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":209.76,"h":212.37,"l":196.84,"c":196.86,"v":4388200},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":201.12,"h":209.95,"l":200.4,"c":209.55,"v":3868800},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":205.79,"h":208.85,"l":201.4,"c":205.51,"v":3088200},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":209.32,"h":216.035,"l":206.4,"c":210.85,"v":5412000},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":214.79,"h":217.1,"l":208.684,"c":210.4,"v":3562200},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":207.67,"h":210.05,"l":200.05,"c":201.35,"v":4004700},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":204.13,"h":205.5,"l":192.807,"c":194.24,"v":4058400},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":192.88,"h":193.42,"l":185.57,"c":186.52,"v":5781700},{"t":"